<h3>HOMA-IR</h3>

The Homeostatic Model Assessment of Insulin Resistance estimates how well
your body responds to insulin, using fasting insulin and fasting glucose.

<h3>QUICKI</h3>

The Quantitative Insulin Sensitivity Check Index is a complementary
measure derived from the same two values.

<h3>Important</h3>

Both indices require genuinely fasting samples. Non-fasting values will
produce meaningless results.
